MOREHOUSE","x":"From the leader of the Goldkett - Russ Morgan."},{"p":52,"b":9,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Russ Morgan. Russ Morgan got in touch with you?"},{"p":52,"b":10,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"He wanted a drummer."},{"p":52,"b":11,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Uh huh. The drummer at that time, before you came was Charlie Horvath."},{"p":52,"b":12,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":52,"b":13,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"So you replaced him as drummer."},{"p":52,"b":14,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"That's right, that's right."},{"p":52,"b":15,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"That would be 1924?"},{"p":52,"b":16,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"I would think, that's correct."},{"p":52,"b":17,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"And the other people at the time were Jimmy Dorsey was in it when you came in?"},{"p":53,"b":0,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Jimmy Dorsey, yeah."},{"p":53,"b":1,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Bill Rank."},{"p":53,"b":2,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":53,"b":3,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Tommy Dorsey, Doc Ryker, Joe Venuti."},{"p":53,"b":4,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah. Let me see this."},{"p":53,"b":5,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"You've got a picture there of the Goldkett band. Is that the one you joined?"},{"p":53,"b":6,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"This is Jimmy Dorsey. Don Murray This is me."},{"p":53,"b":7,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Okay."},{"p":53,"b":8,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"That's me on drums."},{"p":53,"b":9,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Right."},{"p":53,"b":10,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Fuzzy Farrar."},{"p":53,"b":11,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"He was on trumpet."},{"p":53,"b":12,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah and Russ Morgan is here."},{"p":53,"b":13,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Right. Russ Morgan was leading the band. Right?"},{"p":53,"b":14,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"This is Bill Rank."},{"p":53,"b":15,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Bill Rank on trombone, right."},{"p":53,"b":16,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah. Spiegel Wilcox."},{"p":53,"b":17,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Spiegel was playing the trombone also. Who else is in it? Who else?"},{"p":53,"b":18,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Well there they are."},{"p":53,"b":19,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"And that's you sitting in front with all the drums."},{"p":54,"b":0,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Let me see."},{"p":54,"b":1,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Is that him sitting in front?"},{"p":54,"b":2,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Yes, that's Chauncey there. Right here."},{"p":54,"b":3,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Goldkette's stars."}]}